行旋转，时间复杂度为 O(n^2)。</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>: 只旋转每一圈层的元素，时间复杂度降低到 O(n)。</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>: 使用环形数组进行圈层元素的旋转。</li>\n<li><strong>核心思想</strong>: 将每一圈层的元素视为一个环形数组，根据旋转方向进行循环移动。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-3-代码详解\"><a href=\"#4-3-代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.3 代码详解\"></a>4.3 代码详解</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 核心代码段</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> k <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(n // <span class=\"number\">2</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    m = n - <span class=\"number\">2</span> * k</span><br><span class=\"line\">    lst = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 提取一圈元素</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(k, k + m):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        lst.append(original[k][j])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(k + <span class=\"number\">1</span>, k + m - <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        lst.append(original[i][k + m - <span class=\"number\">1</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(k + m - <span class=\"number\">1</span>, k - <span class=\"number\">1</span>, -<span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        lst.append(original[k + m - <span class=\"number\">1</span>][j])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(k + m - <span class=\"number\">2</span>, k, -<span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        lst.append(original[i][k])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 旋转方向判断与循环移动</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    shift = m - <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> k % <span class=\"number\">2</span> == <span class=\"number\">0</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        lst = lst[-shift:] + lst[:-shift]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        lst = lst[shift:] + lst[:shift]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 填回旋转后的元素</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    idx = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(k, k + m):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        matrix[k][j] = lst[idx]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        idx += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(k + <span class=\"number\">1</span>, k + m - <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        matrix[i][k + m - <span class=\"number\">1</span>] = lst[idx]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        idx += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(k + m - <span class=\"number\">1</span>, k - <span class=\"number\">1</span>, -<span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        matrix[k + m - <span class=\"number\">1</span>][j] = lst[idx]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        idx += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(k + m - <span class=\"number\">2</span>, k, -<span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        matrix[i][k] = lst[idx]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        idx += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 4.4 优化技巧</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- 使用环形数组操作，避免了对整个矩阵的旋转，提高了效率。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 6. 复杂度分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- **时间复杂度**: O(n^<span class=\"number\">2</span>)，因为需要遍历矩阵的每一圈层。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **空间复杂度**: O(n)，用于存储环形数组。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 7. 输入输出示例</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- **样例输入**:</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>  4<br>  1 2 3 4<br>  5 6 7 8<br>  9 10 11 12<br>  13 14 15 16<br>  <figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">- **样例输出**:</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br>  4 8 12 16<br>  3 7 11 15<br>  2 6 10 14<br>  1 5 9 13<br>  ```</p>\n<h3 id=\"8-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#8-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"8. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>8. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>: 环形数组操作时容易出现索引越界或顺序错误。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>: 使用打印语句逐步跟踪元素的位置和旋转过程。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"9-总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#9-总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"9. 总结与扩展\"></a>9. 总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>: 学会了如何使用环形数组进行矩阵圈层的旋转。</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>: 可以将类似的思想应用于其他需要旋转圈层元素的问题。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>: 研究更高效的矩阵旋转算法，例如使用位运算或分治法。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"B4378","path":"api/tags/B4378.json"}]}